' The pack window's lines in a v1.2 game (`preset extended ai amiga seed 3
' start 30 give item_leather_jacket,item_gas_mask`: a prepared state). In the
' tent at Paradise Camp the knife is taken in hand and the jacket worn, then
' the mask: `Dmg: 9-16  Def: 20%` (the knife's first row: the boss's 37
' experience counts half), then `Damage: 9-16` with `Gas: 100%` below — the
' mask has no defence. Classic (`preset classic …`, the knife is the fourth
' slot there, `rsceneclick 52,156`) shows `Damage: 9-16` and no defence:
' `dos_unarmoured`. The snaps are the evidence; the numbers are
' `modern_attack::the_inventory_shows_the_blow_in_hand_and_the_armour_worn`.
press escape             ' Back closes the manual v1.2 opens on a new game's first world map (MapScene.cs:687-691)
mapclick 110,122         ' into Paradise Camp
wait 60
mapclick 177,150         ' the tent
wait 200
rsceneclick 124,120      ' the knife in hand
wait 3
rsceneclick 88,156       ' the jacket worn
wait 3
snap inventory_jacket
rsceneclick 124,156      ' the mask worn instead
wait 3
snap inventory_mask
quit
